cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below. Cite the laws themselves by their official names and their publication in the Diario Oficial de la Federación."
type: dataset
title: "leyes-federales-mx: the Mexican federal laws as structured data"
abstract: >-
  The 319 Mexican federal laws published by the Cámara de Diputados (capture of
  26 August 2026), converted from the official Word files into Markdown, a
  SQLite database with full-text search, and CSV: 59,540 articles with their
  hierarchy, parts, reform annotations with DOF dates, and a citation graph.
  Every law is pinned by sha256 to the official file it was converted from.
authors:
  - name: "Baja Labs"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-10"
license:
  - CC0-1.0
  - MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/bajalabs/leyes-federales-mx"
url: "https://github.com/bajalabs/leyes-federales-mx"
keywords:
  - Mexico
  - law
  - legislation
  - open data
  - leyes federales
  - Cámara de Diputados
  - Diario Oficial de la Federación
  - SQLite
  - full-text search
